  "economy.todayLead": "Gaasa e kaɓɓirgol e kuleeji kaɓɓirgol nder ekraan LOADOUT (0.6.0) ina holla sifaa kuutorgol e nguurndam ngam ekonomi ndee yiɗi hokkugo.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Ngam ceede mayre ina yiɗi yoɓugo ɓe. Fijirde ndee fuɗɗotoo ko AI waɗi fuu, ngam ɗum waawa wonde; sirtooɓe yoɓaaɓe caggal ɗuum ina sannja kuugal AI, innde maɓɓe winndaama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Mi waawi fijugo dow intarneet?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Fijirde ndee bilaa yoɓde?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ƴami",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Aa, tawon. Fijirde yimɓe ɗuuɗɓe dow rezo LAN gooto ina kuutina hannde (diga 0.2.0); fijirde dow intarneet waɗaaka.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototaip waɗaama e dow moteer Quake III Arena ɗimɗol (GPL), e hawti laanaaji Elite Dangerous ko hakkiilo. E nyalde ɗiɗmaɓe kooduuji fijirde ndee ngaddi e BuB, moteer kesum winndaama e Claude Code; modil fijirde ndee ngaddi diga prototaip, ɗin innitaama caggal. Bidotooje 0.3.0 hokki gaasaaji kese ngam sifaaji laanaaji 16 fuu. Ndaartugol laawol kooduuji ina ndaara so goɗɗo e kooduuji ɗin hawti ina wurtaa diga GPL tuugorgo, e so tiimugol laanaaji adannde ina ɓadi no feewi e hakkiilo maaɗa. Ndaartugol kooduuji ko masin waɗi, e prototaip GPL, waɗaama <0/>, e ndaartugol yimɓe anndiiɓe e ko tawaa ina yaha. Ko wurtii diga mo fuu, winndete fahin malla tiimeteeɗum fahin. Haa ndaartugol timmi, min ngiɗaa wi'ugo jawaabu ko aa.",
  "faq.questions": "Ƴami",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Laanaaji, nafoore, interfeys e feere, to ceede mbaawi. <0>Defte nder hoodere ndee<\/0> ina limta ko woni fuu e ina holla sannjugol fuu e sirtoowo maako.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Laanaaji e kuutorɗe ina tiimaama wonde heɓeteeɗi e fijo malla soodeteeɗi. No laanaaji yoɓaaɗi ngaɗan ñaawoore ngoore e nder yimɓe e yimɓe ina tiimee haa jooni.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ɗum ko tiimugol: fijirde bilaa yoɓde e sikke nder fijirde ko ɗon ngiɗa e nguurndam. Waɗaaka tawon.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Kuugal goɗɗo kobbaama?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Nde ɗum wurtata, e dow ngale?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ngale pelle yimɓe sannjan, e no mi anndan?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Ngam ndey fijirde AI waɗi wallan sirtooɓe?",
