  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Walaa nyalde wurtugol e walaa njobdi haa jooni.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude e Claude Code ko maaki jawle Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine e Epic Games ko maaki jawle Epic Games, Inc. Blender ko maaka jawle Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena e Elite Dangerous ko maaki jawle woodiiɓe maɓɓe. Inɗe fuu ko jawle woodiiɓe maɓɓe e huutinirtee tan ngam anndingo ko wi'aama. Orion-81 walaa e hawtaago e ɓe, walaa e wallude e ɓe, walaa e jaɓaago ɓe.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Hoolaare tan. Walaa hawtaago, ceerno malla jaɓaago.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Kanal ina wara",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog dow YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Hokku Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Hawtooɓe jaango?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Walaa tokkitirgo. Walaa kuuki. Lewru ndaarirgo. Ko woni fuu ina tokkita arkiv pelle ndee; walaa ko nder ɗoo ko ndaañol malla fortaare.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Wanngaayi to jooni",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Goto ina heeri uddaaki: <0>ndaartugol laawol<\/0> kooduuji fijirde ɗi ngaddi diga prototaip GPL. Ndaartugol kooduuji, ko masin waɗi, e prototaip, waɗaama <1/>, e ndaartugol yimɓe anndiiɓe e ko tawaa ina yaha.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ko pelle ngenndi waɗaama fuu e AI.<\/0> Kooduuji Orion-81 ɓenndi mum ko Claude Code winndi, fuɗɗoowo hollii; laanaaji, karte, teksturi e sawtu waɗaama e kuutiniraaɗe ɗe Claude Code winndi. Wuro-ɗimɗi kooduuji ɗi ɗum huutiniri ɗi limtaama les <1>'Ko AI waɗaayi'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Les lewru",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Les ndee cakkitiiri: modeel ORION-1 nder fijirde diga bidotooje 0.6.1, ina feeñi tawo nder ndaarirgo maaɗa (wayloraama ngam geese, tekstir ustaama haa 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Les ndee cakkitiiri: foto nder fijirde diga bidotooje 0.6.1. 3D ɗon ndaarata ko uddii e kaɓirgol ngol.",
