  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Ɓiɗɗo winndaaɗo fuu dow waɗugol kuugal hakkil, diga moteer haa fijirde (arkiv, limto kuuɗe e bidotooje fuu daaɗaama), e ndaartugol famɗo, jaɓɗo, dow laawol gooto ceede AI ina waawi wallude yimɓe ɓe ɗum ittii kuuɗe.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Ɓannde ceede: ina wi'ee tawon.",
